WEBVTT

00:08:59.116 --> 00:09:04.476
(Laughter and applause)

00:09:04.676 --> 00:09:07.076
It's not a ransom, not a trap.

00:09:07.116 --> 00:09:08.436
Just a friendly nudge.

00:09:08.476 --> 00:09:09.876
I'm only here to help.

00:09:09.916 --> 00:09:14.196
As long as the bank is ready to consider
my demands and give it a try.

00:09:14.796 --> 00:09:21.276
(Laughter and applause)

00:09:22.516 --> 00:09:27.436
We help by providing information and data,

00:09:27.436 --> 00:09:30.436
sometimes better
than private data providers.